{"unit_id":"aoripus__dsh-optimize#card-zh","repo":"aoripus/dsh-optimize","commit":"5259038cb03394d47b3e7dc25ec039c17789f568","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-optimize 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的长会话资源治理插件。它在宿主侧监听请求和会话事件，测量上下文负载、记录每个会话的增长情况，并在达到配置阈值时发出提醒；可选调用 DSH 自带的压缩引擎。浏览器侧为视口外的历史行启用轻量渲染，并提供 composer 开关和设置项。适合需要观察长会话负载、减少历史界面绘制开销的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号；默认不自动压缩，配置状态保存在本机。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:286-402","lib/client.js:174-242"]}
{"unit_id":"aoripus__dsh-optimize#card-en","repo":"aoripus/dsh-optimize","commit":"5259038cb03394d47b3e7dc25ec039c17789f568","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-optimize tracks context load in long DSH sessions and warns at thresholds. It can optionally call DSH's compaction engine. Its web client lightens offscreen chat history rendering, with controls in the composer and settings. No API key is needed; auto-compaction is off by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:286-402","lib/client.js:174-242"]}
